**Project:**SmartSpend
**Course:**INSY 832 Web Technology 

Spring boot rest api for spend requests,finance officers,cost centres,expense type,employees and receipts.
Postgrsql
## Prerequisites
-java 21
-Maven
-Postgresql
-postman

## Database
Create a database name `smartspend_db`.
`src/main/resources/application.properties`
```properties
spring.datasource.url=jdbc:postgresql://localhost/5433/smartspend_db
spring.datasource.username=postgres
spring.datasource.password==your password
spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update
spring.jpa.show-sql=true
server.port=8083

##Run the Api
```bash
./mvnm spring-boot:run

The Api starts at  `http://localhostt:8082'
##Test
Import `smart-spend-midterm.postman_collection.json` from the project root into Postman.Requests are named by requirements ID(B1,A2,C4,D4 ETC)